  "description": "I possessed a mere maid in a Northern Duke’s household, just a background character in a romance-fantasy novel. A lifetime job with stability, as long as I keep my head down and stay out of trouble? Sounds perfect! \n\nI planned to save up quietly and one day escape for a peaceful life... But then. \n\n*“You went to… a Korean cyber university?”* \n\n*“How… how could Annie know that…?”* \n\nThe heroine — reincarnated from modern Korea — found out I’m a transmigrator too! Now I’m stuck to her like glue, constantly in her spotlight… And worse, her overprotective brother starts to take notice. \n\n*“You want to quit your job? Who said you could?”* \n\nThe male lead of this childcare story — the one I thought would ignore me — has become obsessed! Help! I’m just an extra! \n\nAnnie’s chaotic survival tale as an ordinary extra in a not-so-ordinary childcare drama begins! \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
